# The backend image needs only the backend code and the course page it serves. Everything else is
# left out, so .env, data/, real courses, keys and the git history never reach an image.
*
!backend/app
!backend/db
!backend/pyproject.toml
!backend/requirements.txt
!backend/requirements-ml.txt
!web

**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
web/tests
web/node_modules
web/package.json
**/CLAUDE.md
